  "description": "<p>The <strong>Hanging Travel Toiletry Bag</strong> is the perfect solution for organized and stress-free packing on any trip. Designed with multiple compartments and a built-in hook, this organizer keeps your skincare, makeup, and grooming essentials neatly separated and easily accessible. Its water-resistant fabric and durable zip closure ensure your items stay dry and secure, whether you're traveling, camping, or heading to the gym.</p><h2>Key features</h2><ul>\n<li>Multiple inner pockets and spacious main compartment for versatile storage</li>\n<li>Built-in hook for hanging on doors or towel rails, saving counter space</li>\n<li>Water-resistant, wipe-clean fabric with stylish striped design</li>\n<li>Sturdy top handles for easy portability on the go</li>\n<li>Ideal for travel, daily use, or gym &amp; camping storage for men and women</li>\n</ul><h2>Materials &amp; care</h2><p>Made from durable, water-resistant fabric. Wipe clean with a damp cloth. Do not machine wash.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><dl>\n<dt>Q1: What are the dimensions of this toiletry bag?</dt>\n<dd>A: The bag measures approximately 29 cm in length, 20 cm in breadth, and 5 cm in height.</dd>\n<dt>Q2: Is this bag suitable for both men and women?</dt>\n<dd>A: Yes, the versatile design makes it suitable for all genders and travel needs.</dd>\n<dt>Q3: Can I hang this organizer easily in hotel rooms?</dt>\n<dd>A: Absolutely. The built-in hook allows you to hang it on doors, hooks, or towel rails effortlessly.</dd>\n<dt>Q4: Is this bag water-resistant?</dt>\n<dd>A: Yes, it features water-resistant fabric to protect your toiletries from spills and moisture.</dd>\n<dt>Q5: Is the fabric easy to clean?</dt>\n<dd>A: Yes, the wipe-clean fabric makes maintenance simple and quick. Just wipe with a damp cloth.</dd>\n</dl>",
